    "name": "Luxury Private Romantic Dinner Cruise For 2 ",
    "shortDescription": "Indulge and enjoy a private dinner cruise on Melbourne's spectacular Yarra River for you and your partner.",
    "description": "<p>This is a Melbourne must do, imagine cruising down the Yarra River on your private luxury boat enjoying a 3-course dinner and drink on board.&nbsp;</p><p>Enjoy one of Melbourne's unique dining experiences with a delicious 3-course meal on board a luxurious electric boat that is private for just you and your partner.</p><p>There is simply no better way to indulge in a gourmet dining experience, surrounded by the vibrancy of this world-class culinary city while cruising on a luxury boat. &nbsp;This truly is a Melbourne experience not to miss, Melbourne’s first and only Yarra River private dinner cruise experience which includes a scenic cruise along Melbourne’s iconic Yarra River with spectacular breath-taking views and delicious food and wine to savour your taste buds.<br></p><p>Seeing Melbourne city by a boat provides an entirely new viewpoint on the skyline.<br></p><p>Departing from Docklands this 1.5 hr dinner cruise winds up the Yarra River and then returns to Docklands<br></p><p><br></p><p><b>Highlights</b></p><ul><li>Luxury 1.5 hr private cruise for just you and partner</li></ul><ul><li>A luxurious eco-friendly boat which is whisper quiet and has no fumes</li></ul><ul><li>Premium dining experience</li></ul><ul><li>3 Course meal included</li></ul><ul><li>Beer, wine and soft drinks included</li></ul><ul><li>Unbeatable views of Melbourne city</li></ul><ul><li>Friendly and experienced local Skipper</li></ul><p><b>Menu Selections:</b></p><p><u><b>Entree&nbsp;</b></u></p><p>Choice of:&nbsp;</p><p><b>Duo of Dips board to share &nbsp;(v, veo, gf)</b></p><p>Selection of house made dips and assorted breads</p><p><b>Chefs tasting board to share &nbsp;(vo, gf)</b><br></p><p>Chefs' selection of house made delicacies</p><p><b><u>Main:</u></b><br></p><p>Choice of:<br></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Braised Lamb Ricotta Gnocchi&nbsp;</b></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>Fresh ricotta &amp; potato gnocchi, slow braised lamb, red wine, tomato sugo, parmesan, sage</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Mushroom Duxelles Risotto&nbsp;</b><b>(V, VG, DFO)</b></p><p>Truffled mushroom Duxelles, parmesan, garlic &amp; herb King oyster mushroom, truffle oil<br></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Roasted Spatchcock&nbsp;</b><b>(GF)</b><br>Ras el hanout spiced Butterflied spatchcock, chickpea ratatouille, curry leaves</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Parsley &amp; Lemon Gnocchi&nbsp;</b><b>(V, VGO, GF, DFO)</b><br>Fresh parsley &amp; lemon gnocchi, tomato sugo, broccolini, fior di latte, Tuscan kale and olive oil</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Grilled Tiger King Prawn&nbsp;</b><b>(GF, DFO)&nbsp;</b><b>(5pcs)</b><br>QLD sourced King prawn, Authentic Asian slaw, lime, sweet chilli dressing, fried shallots</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Crispy Pork Belly&nbsp;</b><b>(GF, P)</b><br>Slow cooked pork belly, cauliflower puree, broccolini and cranberry jus</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Squid Ink Linguine&nbsp;</b><b>(DFO)&nbsp;</b></p><p>Fresh squid inked linguine, Prawn, scallops, clams, calamari, mussel meats, confit&nbsp;garlic, chili, olive oil, white wine, lemon herb butter</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Beer Battered Fish &amp; Chips&nbsp;</b><b>(DF)</b><br>Battered seasonal fish, tartare, lemon, salad and chips</p><p><b>Eye Fillet&nbsp;</b></p><p>250g grass fed, Huon Creek VIC, mash potato, heirloom carrots, red wine jus (gf)</p><p><br></p><p><b><u>Dessert:</u></b><br></p><p>Selection of dessert petit fours</p><p><br></p><p>V - Vegetarian, VG - Vegan, VGO - Vegan Option, &nbsp;GF - Gluten Free, GFO - Gluten Free Option, VEO - Vegan Option, DF- Dairy Free, &nbsp;DFO - Dairy Free Option</p><p><b>Allergy alert: while stringent precautions are taken, one should assume that contact with peanuts, tree nuts, seeds, wheat, eggs, milk, soy, shellfish and other allergens is possible.</b></p><p><br></p><p></p>",
